  "slug": "apartment-property-walkthrough-report-form",
  "title": "Apartment Property Walkthrough and Action Report",
  "subtitle": "Plan and document a property walkthrough across site, exterior, common areas, visible systems, and authorized unit samples, then prioritize findings, approve work, communicate impacts, and verify closeout.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete apartment property walkthrough report for inspection scope, access controls, immediate hazard routing, photo and reading references, exterior and common-area observations, visible building-system checks, authorized unit sampling, prioritized findings, work authorization, owner updates, resident communication, and completion verification.",
  "use_case": "Use for a periodic, turnover, lender, owner, preventive-maintenance, or concern-driven apartment property walkthrough when staff need one fillable operational record that separates observations from specialist conclusions and assigns every finding to an accountable next action.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
